config/corne.keymap and config/corne.conf are ZMK's, from
https://github.com/zmkfirmware/zmk at v0.3.0 (edf5c0814fd3),
app/boards/shields/corne/, under the licence below. corne.conf has two lines
added at its end (deep sleep, for the baseline).

config/west.yml is the west manifest of ZMK's unified-zmk-config-template
(https://github.com/zmkfirmware/unified-zmk-config-template at 09fce009cdf2,
2025-12-13), with its revision v0.3 changed to v0.3.0. That repository states
no licence of its own; the file is the manifest form ZMK's documentation gives.

github/workflows/build.yml is firmware-zmk's own (Apache-2.0).

